- Complete blood count with differential (focusing on absolute eosinophil count);  
- Quantitative immunoglobulins (IgG, IgA, IgM, IgE);  
- Lymphocyte subset panel (CD3+, CD4+, CD8+, CD19+, CD16/56+ counts).

